module gunbc.plans.self_applying_lenses

import std.dissolution { unbound_dissolution }
import gunbc.plan { Plan, PlanRetirement, PlanRetiresWhen, PlanIsAuthorityOnly }
import std.markdown { MarkdownBlock }
import gunbc.plans.md_helpers { p }
import gunbc.design_ruling { project_documentation_projections_are_not_checkout_artifacts }



fn self_applying_lenses_body() -> List<MarkdownBlock> {
  [
    p(text: "**Goal:** reduce source description to its distinct information by detect → generalize → emit → write. Enforce only the structural minimum expressible by available combinators and a finite proven rewrite catalog; unrestricted minimal description is uncomputable. The minimal form must be expressible and ergonomic. This plan/audit authorizes no code deletions by itself."),
    p(text: "**Method:** one congruent/anti_unify kernel, seeded in v2.lens.simulated_relationship, produces a template plus substitutions. Terms bind varying list elements; type declarations bind type parameters. v2.lens.intent_linearity owns the rule registry; simulated_relationship.chain_is_simulated remains its consumed first detector. Rules reference LensIdV0 from the lens-identity registry rather than coin another identity. Recursively generalize output holes to an irreducible residue. Resolved types, not parse shape alone, establish homogeneous holes across differently shaped coproduct arms."),
    p(text: "**Rewrite schemes:** distinguish foldl, mapAccumL/scan, reduce and table lookup. Dispatch ladders become cited extdeps rows plus generic dispatch, not folds or std policy. Dependency owners are resolve facts, serialize_target ∘ translate and the filesystem write effect; application.apply_diff/substitute_at and application_serializer supply the apply/render mechanisms."),
    p(text: "**Two axes:** source AST redundancy measures change time; cost.dag folds AST into SumCost/ProductCost recurrence and then matches RunTime rows. Each rewrite tags its improved axis: a constant-size byte unroll may reduce source repetition without runtime complexity, while nested loops can have compact source and quadratic runtime. cost.dag remains the detect catamorphism, not a file to delete. complexity’s derived kernel is WallAfterGrounding/SingleAuthority with complexity_incomplete_assessment_stall; unrestricted optimality is OutsideModeledGuarantee (complexity_optimality_boundary) until unrestricted_semantic_complexity_equivalence_procedure. Catalog lowering belongs to v2.lens.complexity_lowering; no RatchetForever arm survives."),
    p(text: "**Registry work:** realize structural_similarity over type-declaration forests, then delete StructuralSimilarityVerdict/TypeShape/FnShapeUnrealized only when the row replaces their live ConstructionJustification. identical_variant_payload waits for that producer’s CarrierCloneTrigger; table_decision_tree already owns dispatch-ladder-to-TotalMap/TotalPolicy and waits for the decision-tree-shape producer. Wire cost’s decidable cheaper-form catalog as RunTime rows. Hand-unrolled CI gates, encoders and ladders are apply outputs, not a manual file-deletion sweep; changes wait for emit and write."),
    p(text: "**Consolidation-only rows:** fact_cardinality, languages_consumer_census and extdeps_shape_transport_policy.TransportFusionFork need a human canonical choice, so remain consolidation/migration ratchets, not automatic rewrites. The latter’s policy-literal/dead-parameter tells are deletion-shaped. fact_density is the conceptual under-description dual of over-description intent-linearity, but its repair requires domain modeling; it stays construction residue, not an anti-unification row."),
    p(text: "**Mechanical proposal:** unused_parameters may propose declaration deletion behind a flag while retaining detect-only operation. Account for call-site cascades and the possibility that the body should use the parameter instead. Do not force delete-versus-repair judgments."),
    p(text: "**Grounding/construction residue:** complexity needs known SymbolicCost for every Accepted node; synthesis EXTRACT needs a cheaper Node or typed catalog refusal for every Established bound; unit_modeling needs total unit_field_rows for numeric-looking names; idempotency needs law proof and ownership a borrow model. Name-only/semantic Rice residues remain OutsideModeledGuarantee (grounding_name_only_residual_boundary, synthesis_rice_residual_boundary), separate from those finite obligations. effect, resolved_imports, visibility, parallelism, coverage, mock_totality, host_language_transport_script, realization_vocabulary_containment, fact_density, leaf_model_verification, discrimination and structural_resolution await their named construction; do not cement patch validators. Visibility has multiple repairs; discrimination requires an authored witness; extdeps_external_authority needs researched upstream anchors. medium_structure_containment was deleted by #6831."),
    p(text: "**Leave machinery:** application/serializer, intent_linearity, registry, affected_set/examples, edit_locus, testgen, subsumption, visibility_test and witness/fixture/producer subtrees support this work and are not detectors to retrofit. **Validate:** S1–S4 stress cases, recursive two-dimensional unrolls, resolved heterogeneous coproduct holes, correct dispatch scheme, preserved behavior and green emit/write application. Realize shared registry producers first, keep ambiguous/undecidable repairs detect-only, and delete scaffolds only on their named triggers. The [original lens-by-lens audit](https://github.com/gunb-ai/gunbc/blob/06d3c1c3149a7420c4a548b9aba9b15c721c635d/dag/gunbc/plans/self_applying_lenses.dag) records historical standings; it is not a current implementation receipt."),
  ]
}

data self_applying_lenses_plan: Plan = Plan {
  projection: PlanIsAuthorityOnly { ruling: project_documentation_projections_are_not_checkout_artifacts },
  slug: "self-applying-lenses",
  title: "Self-applying lenses — detect → generalize → emit → write",
  body: self_applying_lenses_body(),
  retirement: PlanRetiresWhen { condition: unbound_dissolution(description: "Delete this doc when the `v2.lens.intent_linearity` registry's single producer-and-applier is built over the shared anti-unify kernel and the bucket-A rows (`structural_similarity`, `identical_variant_payload`, `table_decision_tree`, `cost`'s RunTime entries) are realized as registry rows wired green through emit + the filesystem-write effect — at which point the consolidation map and audit classification are witnessed properties of the registry and this tracker is redundant (DESIGN §6: the mark on the carrier is the authority).")
  }
}
